    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fiery</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνός</span> Cleanth.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1377
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύκητες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα, πόθος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.14
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.132
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.389
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					2.436
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Π</span>. <i>the planet Mars</i>,
			from its <i>fiery</i> colour, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				399a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).913
			</span></i> (Rhodes, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>ND</u>
				2.20.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Eph.
			</span></i> ap. Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.139
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.504
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> as
			epith. of divinities, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
			</span></i>, as Ares, <i><span class="en">
				41.348
			</span></i>; Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				21.222
			</span></i>; Hephaestus, <i><span class="en">
				2.225
			</span></i>; Zeus, <i><span class="en">
				6.218
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροῦντες, οἱ</span>, a sort of <i>trout</i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.358c
			</span></i>.</div>
